Test case (2): test case kisi function ke khaas inputs aur mutawaqqa output (aur jaanch ki sharait) tay karta hai. Python tests chala kar failures ya errors batata hai.

Program (file test_grade.py) (6):
def grade(marks):
    if marks >= 80:
        return "A"
    elif marks >= 60:
        return "B"
    else:
        return "C"

def test_grade_a():
    assert grade(85) == "A"

def test_grade_b():
    assert grade(60) == "B"

def test_grade_c():
    assert grade(45) == "C"

Wazahat:
1. Har test function test_ se shuru hota hai, is liye pytest use khud dhoond kar chalata hai.
2. Har test aik input (85, 60, 45) deta hai aur assert se mutawaqqa grade check karta hai; 60 grade B ki had (boundary) check karta hai.
3. Tests chalane ke liye file ke folder mein command line par pytest chalayein.
4. pytest ka nateeja: 3 passed. Agar baad mein koi tabdeeli grade() ko kharab kare to fail hone wala test bata dega; yun baar baar testing purane kaam ki hifazat karti hai.

